    "ss_feature_15_atJbU4": {
      "type": "ss-feature-15",
      "blocks": {
        "item_Hm7hUG": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "atc",
            "heading": "Starts as a Freestanding Candle",
            "text": "<p>Each refill begins as a freestanding candle designed to fit inside a compatible vessel. No permanent container is included, allowing you to choose the vessel that works best for your space.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_TXp9yw": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "shield",
            "heading": "Settles Into Place",
            "text": "<p>As the candle burns, the outer wax wall gradually softens and settles into the shape of the container. This creates the familiar experience of a traditional container candle.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_my3JNy": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "atc",
            "heading": "Burns Like a Traditional Candle",
            "text": "<p>Once settled, the refill burns much like a conventional container candle while continuing to use the vessel you already own.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_gqwFEH": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "atc",
            "heading": "Ready for Another Refill",
            "text": "<p>After the candle is finished, remove the remaining wax and wick tabs, clean the vessel, and begin again with a new scent.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
